Description: 'ginieq' is a data analysis package that estimates the gini index of a country's administrative units
    using remotely sensed nighttime light and population data in CSV format. 'ginieq' will load and wrangle the data, 
    calculate the per-capital nightlight emission values and 
    calculate the spatial gini index per year and temporal gini index for each admisnistrative unit.
